.IX Title "ExtUtils::Command::MM 3"
.TH ExtUtils::Command::MM 3 2026-03-03 "perl v5.40.0" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
